# Targeted Restrictions & Live API Pricing

Refine the storefront by disabling sales for specific sets and integrating live API data for price comparisons.

## Proposed Changes

### Controllers

#### [MODIFY] [Store.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php)
- Update [view_mtg_card](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#85-94) to fetch live pricing from the Scryfall API using the card's name and set code.
- Pass this live data to the view for comparison.

### Storefront Views

#### [MODIFY] [view_mtg_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_mtg_set.php)
- **C17 Restriction**: Hide the "Add to Cart" button if the set code is 'C17'.

#### [MODIFY] [view_mtg_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_mtg_card.php)
- **Live Comparison**: Display "Your Shop Price" alongside "Live Market Price (API)".
- **Visual Feedback**: Highlight the difference if the prices are significantly divergent.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Visual Check**: Open the Magic set and card views to verify the restriction and the new pricing UI.
- **Accuracy**: Ensure the live price is correctly pulled from Scryfall.
